  "notes": "PROMPT_GT_MISMATCH: prompt asks for a temporary green environment that is created for traffic routing and terminated afterwards, but the ground truth only has a GreenEnvironmentName parameter and no green environment, routing or termination logic. Only what both guarantee is checked (green_environment_capability); the row needs prompt or ground-truth repair. Creating the application and environment is a toggle, so they are checked as declared, not on the planned type, and every declared environment must be gated. Whether the region is appended only for the default bucket is not observable under defaults, so the appended region and a bucket parameter are checked separately. Amazon Linux 2 platforms are no longer accepted as modern supported (AL2 end of support 2026-06-30). PlatformArn taken from a custom resource that resolves the platform is accepted, since its value can't be read. bucket_override_parameter is a name match only, because the default-only condition on the region suffix is not observable. Real-output review (2026-11-10): GLM53F and Gemini38F create the blue environment unconditionally, so an existing environment can't be referenced; DSV4F uses an Amazon Linux 2 Node.js 18 stack. Kept."
